Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.13,0:00:32.14,Pray Translation,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6}Now I break free beyond this cage
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.14,0:00:37.90,Pray Translation,\q2,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\q2}The rusted key rings out, my heart still pounding
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.90,0:00:42.67,Pray Translation,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6}I knew it all along.. there's no turning back
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.67,0:00:47.94,Pray Translation,\fs40,0,0,0,,{\fs40\blur0.6}The days we've lost (Hey baby why?)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.94,0:00:53.49,Pray Translation,\fs32\q2,0,0,0,,{\fs32\blur0.6\q2}Now weave together in shades of blue (I want to cry...)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.49,0:00:58.62,Pray Translation,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6}I don't want to lose to my fearful self
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.62,0:01:04.42,Pray Translation,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6}I won't run away from my fate, "I'm not alone"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.42,0:01:08.26,Pray Translation,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6}I'll stay right by your side, no matter what
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.26,0:01:15.22,Pray Translation,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6}Even if the dream we share is filled with sorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.22,0:01:20.02,Pray Translation,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6}I want to reach out and touch your tears... baby
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.02,0:01:22.85,Pray Translation,\fs37,0,0,0,,{\fs37\blur0.6}I pray, "Believe in me"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.85,0:01:28.90,Pray Translation,\fs32\q2,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fs32}As I tear through the darkness of our frozen memories
